{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-08-17 07:00:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS NAMES MANDEVILLE TO LEAD CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT, DRIVE M&A AND PARTNERSHIP GROWTH STRATEGY', 'text': "CORK, IRELAND, AUG. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS\xa0(NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FRANÇOIS MANDEVILLE HAS JOINED THE COMPANY AS ITS CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT OFFICER. MANDEVILLE WILL PLAY A LEAD ROLE IN THE SELECTION, EXECUTION AND INTEGRATION OF MERGERS AND ACQUISITIONS THAT FURTHER THE COMPANY'S BUSINESS GROWTH STRATEGY."}